`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["On Slack Enterprise Grid, when a Slack Org Owner or Org Admin sends ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"@Claude connect"}),", the reply carries two codes: ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"workspace_…"})," pairs one workspace, and ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"enterprise_…"})," pairs the whole grid. One-to-one DMs work only for people whose home workspace is paired, so pair the grid if they should work for everyone. ",(0,n.jsx)(r.a,{href:"https://claude.com/docs/claude-tag/admins/setup-overview#pair-your-slack-workspace",children:"The pairing steps in the setup docs"})," cover both codes and have the complete walkthrough."]}),`
