`]}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"Channel spend counts toward two limits at once, the organization-wide limit and each channel's own, and Claude Tag declines new work in a channel when either is reached. Group DM work counts the same way, with your default limit for channels applying to each group DM."}),`
