`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["The ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"Channels"})," tab under ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"Claude’s access"})," (section 4) is the roster: every channel Claude Tag has been added to appears there automatically, whether it has spent anything or not. Spend by channel and per-channel limits live on the Usage page, and the Analytics page shows spend by channel read-only, including promotional-credit usage that the Usage page reports as $0.00 (section 6 also has the reseller note)."]}),`
